See own jobs:
watch squeue --me

Interactive shell on compute node:
srun --pty --partition=sgpu_devel --time=0-01:00:00 --gpus=1 --ntasks=1 --account=ag_hiskp_funcke /bin/bash

See gpu usage:
sreport -t HourPer cluster UserUtilizationByAccount START=2024-01-01 -T gres/gpu | grep s6nidich


See node counts Allocated (alloc,mix,drain) / Idle / Other / Total per partition:
sinfo -s
sinfo -o "%15R %15F %25C %20N"

See cpu counts Allocated / Idle / Other / Total per node for a specific partition:
sinfo -o "%15n %15C %10eMB   %10O %E" -p lm_long